WEBVTT

00:03.927 --> 00:06.012
God dammit…

00:08.890 --> 00:10.808
Freakin' pisses me off.

00:11.184 --> 00:13.561
Where'd that damn thing go?

00:17.148 --> 00:20.025
<i>Anjuro Katagiri, a.k.a. Angelo.</i>

00:21.402 --> 00:24.446
<i>Known as the sickest, most heinous
criminal in Japanese history</i>

00:26.241 --> 00:28.993
<i>He continually murdered
from the age of twelve,</i>

00:29.410 --> 00:30.411
<i>his final homicide being…</i>

00:30.495 --> 00:32.788
Milkman! Watch where you step!

00:32.872 --> 00:34.790
<i>…viler than
the foulest dog shit.</i>

00:36.417 --> 00:38.961
<i>In March, 1994,</i>

00:39.629 --> 00:42.506
<i>he came across three
fourteen-year-old boys,</i>

00:42.757 --> 00:44.967
<i>two of which he proceeded
to rape and murder.</i>

00:46.427 --> 00:47.553
Step in something?

00:48.054 --> 00:49.305
Suppose I did.

00:49.514 --> 00:51.641
Freakin' pisses me off!

00:51.808 --> 00:54.310
Someone's letting their dog shit
in front of my house…

00:54.435 --> 00:55.978
I think I might just keep it

00:56.062 --> 00:59.315
to dump in the owner's
pocket tomorrow morning.

00:59.899 --> 01:03.068
Um… I left your milk over there.

01:03.486 --> 01:04.653
Until next time.

01:06.823 --> 01:07.990
Hey…

01:08.491 --> 01:11.160
I don't recognize you.

01:12.954 --> 01:15.748
Yeah, I'm just a temp for today.

01:15.999 --> 01:16.833
Huh…

01:17.750 --> 01:20.919
<i>The third boy came from
a rich family,</i>

01:21.004 --> 01:22.505
<i>so Angelo demanded ransom.</i>

01:23.089 --> 01:25.091
<i>That's what led to his arrest.</i>

01:25.758 --> 01:30.258
Hate to nitpick,
but the seal's broken.

01:30.763 --> 01:31.513
Huh?

01:31.639 --> 01:32.681
Is that so?

01:32.807 --> 01:35.100
Look for yourself, here!

01:35.351 --> 01:36.352
You don't say…

01:36.436 --> 01:37.645
It's broken, see?

01:37.729 --> 01:40.690
Yeah. Sorry about that.

01:40.773 --> 01:41.857
Well, so long!

01:41.941 --> 01:43.317
Thanks.

01:43.401 --> 01:44.443
Welcome.

01:45.820 --> 01:47.655
Damn bitch!

01:49.908 --> 01:52.535
Sharp-eyed little vixen.

01:52.702 --> 01:56.122
If only that shrew and punk
Josuke had drunk the milk,

01:56.289 --> 01:58.499
my Stand, Aqua Necklace,

01:58.583 --> 02:00.543
would've already
overpowered them!

02:04.756 --> 02:05.798
More?

02:05.882 --> 02:07.800
You are a good
little shitter, aren't you?

02:09.719 --> 02:12.972
<i>When the police raided
Angelo's torture den,</i>

02:13.181 --> 02:15.057
<i>they found a horrific sight.</i>

02:15.850 --> 02:18.394
<i>The boy lay murdered,
his genitalia</i>

02:18.519 --> 02:21.730
<i>severed and nailed to
the pillar that stood nearby</i>

02:36.162 --> 02:39.748
Worthless bastard…
Can't pick up your own dog's shit, huh?

02:39.874 --> 02:42.960
Had to toss your dirty cig
on the ground, huh?

02:43.544 --> 02:46.255
Well you got whatcha deserved,
smug bastard!

02:46.631 --> 02:49.091
You wanna be a
goddamn pompous ass?

02:53.096 --> 02:57.596
Then you'll swallow my Stand
and die like the dirty rat you are!

03:20.999 --> 03:23.459
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

03:24.627 --> 03:27.963
<i>These faceless gazes pass by one another</i>

03:28.298 --> 03:31.634
<i>A wound to the heart changes our everyday</i>

03:31.843 --> 03:36.343
<i>Encounters without boundaries
The bizarre is our normal U-yeh</i>

03:38.808 --> 03:42.144
<i>These ordinary mornings,
we're laughing on the surface</i>

03:42.228 --> 03:45.856
<i>Mysteries drawn to each other,
identity still unknown</i>

03:45.940 --> 03:50.440
<i>Without a heads up,
it's quietly lurking somewhere in this town</i>

03:55.033 --> 03:59.533
<i>Although we bicker and complain
In the end, we celebrate</i>

04:02.081 --> 04:05.459
<i>Dancing through the everyday</i>

04:05.543 --> 04:10.043
<i>Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town</i>

04:26.564 --> 04:31.064
EPISODE 2
JOSUKE HIGASHIKATA! MEETS ANGELO

04:27.899 --> 04:32.174
Well, it looked like the Stand
took over the robber's body…

04:33.780 --> 04:38.201
I mean, he jumped into his body.
He didn't attack me.

04:38.659 --> 04:40.035
Was Angelo nearby?

04:40.495 --> 04:41.704
You know, the guy in the picture.

04:41.829 --> 04:43.914
Nope, didn't see him.

04:44.290 --> 04:47.001
<i>Dammit,
my hair looks like shit today</i>

04:48.920 --> 04:49.670
Listen.

04:49.837 --> 04:53.173
His Stand's weak, but he can
control him from afar.

04:53.591 --> 04:56.719
It somehow infiltrates
people's bodies.

04:57.637 --> 04:59.055
I'll be at your house soon.

04:59.305 --> 05:00.431
Huh? Soon?

05:00.598 --> 05:04.059
Don't eat or drink anything
till I get there.

05:04.143 --> 05:05.519
That includes tap water.

05:05.603 --> 05:07.688
And stay away from the shower
and bathroom. Got it?

05:07.772 --> 05:08.898
Hold on a sec.

05:09.357 --> 05:12.276
I still haven't told
my mom you're here.

05:12.693 --> 05:17.193
She's usually pretty tough,
but he still makes her cry.

05:18.866 --> 05:20.659
I think she still loves Mr. Joestar.

05:20.910 --> 05:23.621
One look at you, and she'll know
exactly who you are.

05:23.955 --> 05:26.582
Josuke, where'd you get
this picture?

05:27.542 --> 05:29.502
It's the milkman
from this morning…

05:29.710 --> 05:31.128
You know him?

05:37.552 --> 05:38.761
Josuke! What's wrong?

05:38.928 --> 05:40.471
Crap! I'm too late!

05:40.555 --> 05:44.267
It was hiding in my mom's coffee,
now it's in her mouth!

05:44.392 --> 05:47.269
Hello? Josuke? Hey! Josuke!

05:48.980 --> 05:50.982
Josuke, want some coffee?

05:51.107 --> 05:54.777
Sure, why not?
Milk and sugar, too?

05:55.194 --> 05:56.987
Milk and sugar it is.

06:11.085 --> 06:13.712
Josuke? Milk and sugar, right?

06:13.921 --> 06:14.880
Yeah.

06:15.673 --> 06:17.800
Hello? Mr. Jotaro?

06:18.176 --> 06:20.178
I got him, but…

06:20.261 --> 06:21.011
What?

06:22.305 --> 06:24.557
What do I do with him?

06:24.682 --> 06:26.183
<i>How in the hell…</i>

06:27.059 --> 06:27.768
Careful.

06:27.852 --> 06:31.146
Angelo's likely spying
on your house as we speak.

06:31.314 --> 06:33.149
Keep your eyes glued
to that Stand.

06:33.274 --> 06:34.191
I'll be right there.

06:40.531 --> 06:43.659
<i>Angelo survived his execution
and broke out of prison</i>

06:43.910 --> 06:45.703
<i>only because he had use
of a Stand</i>

06:46.454 --> 06:50.207
<i>Exactly what he can do,
I still don't know</i>

06:53.961 --> 06:55.128
<i>Dead ball!</i>

06:55.379 --> 06:56.338
<i>Sayonara!</i>

06:56.547 --> 06:59.299
<i>Dead ball, game over, sayonara!</i>

07:02.303 --> 07:03.721
That's a good boy.

07:04.722 --> 07:06.807
You little shit!

07:07.016 --> 07:07.599
Josuke!

07:07.683 --> 07:09.726
– I'll murder them both!
– Get a move on or you'll be late!

07:09.810 --> 07:12.103
That little pissant and
his smoking hot mom!

07:13.314 --> 07:15.232
I've got to get that damn cap off…

07:15.483 --> 07:18.444
Or break the bottle…

07:28.663 --> 07:30.706
Is that…

07:31.499 --> 07:33.584
– Higashikata…
– Home.

07:33.668 --> 07:35.670
– I know that name.
– I'm too old for this night shift crap.

07:36.379 --> 07:39.882
So this is
Officer Higashikata's house.

07:41.634 --> 07:44.970
Last we met, I was twelve.
Those were the good ol' days!

07:45.680 --> 07:48.724
I know everything there is to
know about you.

07:48.808 --> 07:50.601
Everything, fucker!

07:51.519 --> 07:52.686
Freeze.

07:53.771 --> 07:55.939
Josuke, what happened to
going to class?

07:56.065 --> 07:58.609
Grandpa! They let you
take your gun home now?

07:58.859 --> 08:00.318
Stuff it, smart ass! Answer me!

08:00.528 --> 08:03.614
I-I'm going!
I'm just waiting for someone.

08:06.534 --> 08:09.578
You goober!
You're looking at a toy gun!

08:10.371 --> 08:11.663
I really gotcha good.

08:11.831 --> 08:15.251
Guess that means the first win
this week goes to me!

08:15.543 --> 08:18.128
Fine, fine. You win.

08:18.838 --> 08:21.715
What's the matter?
Not gonna even argue with me?

08:21.882 --> 08:24.217
I'm fine. And mom already left.

08:24.385 --> 08:26.929
Shouldn't you be in bed?
You must be tired.

08:27.054 --> 08:28.013
<i>Now, for our next story</i>

08:28.556 --> 08:30.349
<i>The death count in a bizarre
chain of grisly incidents</i>

08:30.433 --> 08:32.309
<i>involving severe internal trauma
to the victims' eyes and ears</i>

08:32.435 --> 08:35.312
<i>has risen this morning to
a staggering seven.</i>

08:36.897 --> 08:39.608
<i>While the incident appears to be
isolated to the town of Morioh,</i>

08:39.734 --> 08:41.569
<i>police are now working to
determine whether the trauma</i>

08:41.777 --> 08:44.488
<i>can be tied to disease
or aggressive behavior.</i>

08:44.989 --> 08:46.991
This isn't the first
I've heard of this.

08:47.074 --> 08:49.826
If you ask me,
this is no accident.

08:52.079 --> 08:55.332
Something wicked is
lurking in this town.

08:55.416 --> 08:56.875
I can feel it.

08:57.877 --> 08:58.961
Grandpa…

09:01.756 --> 09:03.257
He's here…

09:05.760 --> 09:08.637
I know all your quirks, Higashikata.

09:08.971 --> 09:13.471
Nothing like a nice brandy
after a long night's work, right?

09:28.282 --> 09:30.742
Josuke, grab the bottle and get in.

09:31.160 --> 09:32.661
We'll take it where
no one can get hurt.

09:32.787 --> 09:33.829
Good idea.

09:41.754 --> 09:43.714
G-Grandpa…

09:47.468 --> 09:49.219
Josuke Higashikata!

09:49.470 --> 09:51.680
You've really messed up now!

09:51.847 --> 09:56.226
You looked away,
and now you're shit outta luck!

09:57.478 --> 10:00.606
You got too cocky,
you little prick!

10:01.816 --> 10:03.692
I have to say it's invigorating

10:03.776 --> 10:08.276
bringing a pretentious bastard crashing
down to earth in a puddle of despair!

10:16.831 --> 10:19.375
Close! Impressive…

10:19.583 --> 10:21.668
Still think you're hot shit, eh?

10:21.919 --> 10:23.253
You're a dead man!

10:23.421 --> 10:25.131
Hear that? Your life is over!

10:30.344 --> 10:32.804
Grandpa opened the bottle.

10:33.180 --> 10:35.015
Don't worry, I've got this.

10:35.558 --> 10:39.979
It just looks bad.
My Stand can easily…

10:50.322 --> 10:51.614
All better.

10:57.204 --> 10:59.122
No, there's no way he's…

10:59.832 --> 11:02.084
He'll open his eyes any second.

11:02.209 --> 11:04.419
My Stand heals people.

11:04.545 --> 11:06.588
I've done it a million times.

11:06.881 --> 11:09.091
I fixed my friends' broken bones…

11:09.842 --> 11:11.093
Grandpa! Hey!

11:11.302 --> 11:12.928
Quit messing around!

11:13.053 --> 11:15.972
Don't tell me you've
passed out from last night's shift?

11:16.140 --> 11:19.017
Come on, enough with
all the stupid games!

11:19.560 --> 11:22.062
Grandpa! Grandpa!

11:22.396 --> 11:23.397
Josuke…

11:24.565 --> 11:26.483
I've healed him…

11:31.363 --> 11:35.742
It's said the human organism
must destroy in order to survive.

11:36.535 --> 11:38.912
Your power is an unparalleled act
of compassion

11:38.996 --> 11:40.914
in an otherwise brutal world.

11:41.791 --> 11:44.960
But no amount of love,

11:45.294 --> 11:46.628
can bring back a life lost.

11:49.131 --> 11:52.425
No Stand
can break death's grip.

12:01.727 --> 12:04.020
For thirty-five years,

12:04.104 --> 12:08.066
he never stopped looking
after this town.

12:08.776 --> 12:10.986
He could tell
danger was lurking…

12:11.612 --> 12:13.697
And when he heard
news breaking of

12:13.781 --> 12:16.200
Angelo's return to murder,

12:16.283 --> 12:19.452
I saw a man of honor,
ready to protect his people.

12:22.122 --> 12:24.207
Angelo has left many victims
in his wake.

12:24.792 --> 12:27.211
It's safe to say
many other victims

12:27.294 --> 12:28.586
from Morioh lie waiting
to be uncovered.

12:29.421 --> 12:31.339
His murders are without motive.

12:31.423 --> 12:32.715
He kills for the thrill of killing.

12:32.800 --> 12:34.551
And he'll keep murdering.

12:35.219 --> 12:39.598
After he kills you and your mother.

12:50.985 --> 12:51.819
I'll…

12:52.736 --> 12:57.236
I'll take the baton.
I'll protect mom and this town.

12:58.158 --> 13:00.201
Nothing will stop me.

13:05.332 --> 13:08.043
AQUA NECKLACE
ANJURO KATAGIRI

13:11.505 --> 13:13.423
<i>Services have come to a close.</i>

13:13.632 --> 13:16.718
<i>His uniform hangs lifelessly
in the closet.</i>

13:17.344 --> 13:21.844
<i>Alongside, his shoes, socks, shirts,
and pants recall</i>

13:24.518 --> 13:29.018
<i>an elderly but youthful spirit,
unapologetic of his idiosyncrasies.</i>

13:30.691 --> 13:34.444
<i>Eventually, his belongings
will likely be discarded</i>

13:36.238 --> 13:37.906
<i>For, despite his daughter's</i>

13:38.032 --> 13:41.285
<i>reluctance to part with
her cherished mementos,</i>

13:41.535 --> 13:44.663
<i>his possessions will
never be worn again.</i>

13:48.042 --> 13:51.920
<i>I'm sure Josuke needs
his privacy right now</i>

14:04.683 --> 14:07.143
Don't touch anything that's not
from a bottle or can.

14:07.227 --> 14:08.853
We can't afford to take any risks.

14:10.898 --> 14:11.940
Where'd your mom go?

14:12.483 --> 14:14.902
I had her visit our relatives'
after the funeral.

14:15.569 --> 14:16.403
Wise man.

14:16.820 --> 14:18.822
She can return after
we knock the shit out of Angelo.

14:20.950 --> 14:23.285
I'm not pissed, you know.

14:23.535 --> 14:26.162
Just got a little worked up,
that's all.

14:26.872 --> 14:29.332
Never been calmer, in fact.

14:30.000 --> 14:31.334
Never been calmer, huh?

14:33.087 --> 14:35.464
Well, it is your house.

14:35.547 --> 14:38.466
Suppose you can take it out
on whatever please.

14:39.093 --> 14:41.970
By the way,
that scratch on your lip…

14:42.763 --> 14:45.307
I gave that to you
when I punched you, didn't I?

14:45.766 --> 14:48.602
Can't your Stand heal
your own wounds?

14:48.811 --> 14:51.647
No, my Stand can't heal
my own wounds.

14:52.231 --> 14:56.731
What if his Stand infiltrates your body
and tries to eat his way out?

14:57.611 --> 14:58.653
Then I guess I'm dead.

14:59.863 --> 15:02.532
He gets me, I lose.

15:06.578 --> 15:10.373
Think you can trap my
Stand in a bottle again, huh?

15:12.710 --> 15:17.210
Well, think again.
I already know what you can do.

15:20.092 --> 15:22.094
Tomorrow or the next day…

15:22.177 --> 15:25.221
My moment'll come.
And I've got all the time in the world!

15:27.391 --> 15:30.394
— 3 DAYS LATER —

15:32.688 --> 15:35.607
He's sniffing around here
right under our noses…

15:35.691 --> 15:38.568
But it's been three days,
and he still hasn't made a move.

15:39.653 --> 15:42.364
What's he waiting for?

15:52.166 --> 15:53.375
It's raining…

15:56.837 --> 15:58.213
Rain?

16:06.305 --> 16:07.347
What the hell?

16:07.514 --> 16:09.265
I thought there was
something fishy about you.

16:09.349 --> 16:11.142
So you're a Stand user, too, eh?

16:12.478 --> 16:15.606
No matter.
My moment is finally here.

16:15.689 --> 16:17.524
This house is mine!

16:18.025 --> 16:20.652
You're not going anywhere
in this rain!

16:28.285 --> 16:29.202
Josuke!

16:32.956 --> 16:35.291
He must've just boiled the water.

16:35.834 --> 16:37.669
He left all the faucets on, too.

16:37.878 --> 16:40.380
I just saw Angelo's Stand
enter the house.

16:40.839 --> 16:43.591
He wasn't waiting for you
to drink the water.

16:44.468 --> 16:46.011
He was waiting for the rain!

16:46.470 --> 16:48.138
His Stand can move anywhere
in the rain…

16:48.597 --> 16:49.431
No…

16:49.723 --> 16:52.100
It can move between
liquid and vapor!

16:56.063 --> 16:58.231
Josuke! Get away from the kettle!

16:59.441 --> 17:00.984
He morphed into the steam!

17:09.076 --> 17:10.786
Just great.

17:10.953 --> 17:13.121
We can't capture him
in the bottle.

17:13.205 --> 17:15.957
Stay away from any steam.
Protect your lungs!

17:16.083 --> 17:17.417
We need to get out of here.

17:17.793 --> 17:19.002
Yeah, about that…

17:19.378 --> 17:22.005
I'm not so sure there's
a whole lot we can do.

17:24.091 --> 17:28.470
Angelo's already put a bunch
of holes in the roof.

17:29.221 --> 17:32.349
Upstairs'll be no better,
and we'll be sitting ducks outside.

17:33.100 --> 17:35.811
This is just great…

17:49.032 --> 17:50.992
Gotta admit
this liquid-morphing Stand

17:51.118 --> 17:55.080
is a lot freakier
than I anticipated.

17:56.290 --> 17:58.000
He's a clever bastard.

18:02.629 --> 18:03.838
What's so funny?

18:04.131 --> 18:06.007
Son of a bitch's got us trapped!

18:07.426 --> 18:08.176
Hey!

18:08.677 --> 18:10.762
Well, Mr. Jotaro…

18:10.971 --> 18:15.183
Grandpa's killer just about
handed himself in.

18:16.393 --> 18:18.978
Pretty great, isn't it?!

18:23.192 --> 18:26.028
Time to finish this.

18:39.666 --> 18:40.792
So, Josuke…

18:41.168 --> 18:42.794
What do you think?

18:44.213 --> 18:45.422
How do we get out of this?

18:45.881 --> 18:47.048
Get out?

18:48.634 --> 18:51.762
I'm thinking more…

18:56.433 --> 18:58.268
Home improvement!

18:58.769 --> 18:59.853
Come on, this way!

19:00.187 --> 19:02.063
The wall's gonna repair itself.

19:02.189 --> 19:03.732
Good grief.

19:06.818 --> 19:08.236
Well, we've blocked the steam…

19:11.114 --> 19:11.906
The humidifier!

19:13.784 --> 19:14.493
Josuke!

19:14.576 --> 19:15.410
I win!

19:15.619 --> 19:17.245
Just as I predicted, Josuke!

19:17.329 --> 19:20.540
I thought you'd break through
the wall and come into this room!

19:21.124 --> 19:22.458
Shit!

19:24.211 --> 19:26.796
I guess it's like
winning at the races

19:26.880 --> 19:30.091
or picking all the
right answers on a test…

19:30.259 --> 19:34.759
When you guess right,
you can't help but giggle!

19:35.889 --> 19:37.640
It just happens!

19:41.395 --> 19:42.479
Josuke!

19:43.230 --> 19:46.650
Angelo's got it all wrong,
Mr. Jotaro.

19:48.235 --> 19:48.985
Josuke?

19:49.653 --> 19:52.489
Whenever my prediction
proves true,

19:52.572 --> 19:55.992
I don't feel like laughing…

19:56.493 --> 19:59.370
Not when it comes to Angelo.

20:03.750 --> 20:04.751
That's…

20:05.085 --> 20:06.461
Got him.

20:06.753 --> 20:09.130
It is kinda gross.
My apologies.

20:09.589 --> 20:12.925
I cut up a rubber glove into
little pieces and swallowed it.

20:17.514 --> 20:18.181
Slick.

20:18.265 --> 20:20.517
Looks like
the user's over there.

20:23.603 --> 20:25.187
Sh-Shit!

20:30.193 --> 20:31.360
So you're…

20:31.611 --> 20:32.570
…Angelo.

20:33.030 --> 20:34.990
Son of a bitch!

20:42.039 --> 20:46.043
You guys wouldn't kill me!

20:46.585 --> 20:50.046
Sure, I escaped death row.

20:50.339 --> 20:53.383
Sure, Japanese law
found me guilty.

20:53.467 --> 20:55.886
But you guys have no
right to do anything to me!

20:56.303 --> 20:57.387
Josuke!

20:57.763 --> 21:00.348
I killed your grandpa,

21:00.432 --> 21:02.976
but you can't put me to death!

21:03.393 --> 21:07.893
If you kill me, you'll end up
cursed, like yours truly!

21:12.152 --> 21:15.697
Didn't your mommy ever
teach you it's rude to point?

21:16.823 --> 21:20.117
M-M-My hand! My hand!

21:21.119 --> 21:23.538
No one's going to execute you.

21:23.914 --> 21:26.207
Not me or Mr. Jotaro, here.

21:26.875 --> 21:28.835
For you, there will be no execution,

21:29.419 --> 21:31.170
and no incarceration.

21:31.588 --> 21:33.548
Josuke, you handle the rest.

21:33.632 --> 21:37.302
Wh-What the hell you
gonna do, you bastards?!

21:37.511 --> 21:39.679
Enjoy your
eternal penance, Angelo!

21:39.971 --> 21:41.806
Contemplate the life
you took from grandpa,

21:41.890 --> 21:43.474
and everyone else you killed!

21:54.528 --> 21:56.571
Here, you'll remain for all eternity,

21:57.197 --> 21:58.907
in the town my grandfather
loved and protected.

22:02.702 --> 22:03.578
<i>Angelo's Rock.</i>

22:03.537 --> 22:08.037
MORIOH LANDMARK 1
ANGELO'S ROCK
ONE MINUTE WALK FROM
MORIOH JOZENJI STREET BUS STOP #3

22:03.829 --> 22:06.122
<i>Angelo's Rock: town landmark</i>

22:06.289 --> 22:09.125
<i>and hot-spot for
romantic rendezvous.</i>

22:09.292 --> 22:11.210
<i>For years it's charmed
the residents of Morioh,</i>

22:11.420 --> 22:13.088
<i>despite its slightly
disturbing appearance.</i>

22:16.967 --> 22:20.178
<i>This guy's bat shit crazy</i>

22:22.764 --> 22:24.140
<i>Good grief..</i>

23:38.507 --> 23:41.510
EPISODE 3
THE NIJIMURA BROTHERS, PART 1
